Add agentic date format auto-detection, fix pagination and bulk category edit

- Smart date detector scans file data to determine DD/MM vs MM/DD format
  using multiple signals: values >12, chronological ordering, distribution
- Shows detection reasoning and confidence on import mapping page with
  user override option (auto/UK/US radio buttons)
- Fix pagination passing empty filter params causing 422 validation errors
- Fix bulk category edit JS bug where dropdown value was lost before submit
